WEBVTT

00:00:16.120 --> 00:00:17.910
I see.

00:00:17.910 --> 00:00:20.120
Because Majic stole a book,

00:00:20.120 --> 00:00:23.370
my head got split open,
and Tish was gravely injured.

00:00:23.370 --> 00:00:28.540
In order to make sure they don't
attack us any further, we need to strike first.

00:00:28.540 --> 00:00:31.330
Do you really understand what's going on?

00:00:31.330 --> 00:00:34.290
I got the gist of it, so it's fine.

00:00:34.290 --> 00:00:35.500
Master.

00:00:35.500 --> 00:00:37.830
What is it, you little thief?

00:00:37.830 --> 00:00:40.790
It's not like I meant to steal this book.

00:00:40.790 --> 00:00:45.120
But Leticia was hurt
because I walked away with this...

00:00:56.000 --> 00:00:58.000
That wasn't your fault.

00:00:58.000 --> 00:00:59.330
Sooner or later,

00:00:59.330 --> 00:01:03.330
we were going to have to settle things
with the Uoar Class anyway.

00:01:03.330 --> 00:01:06.330
But we have to get inside for that, right?

00:01:06.330 --> 00:01:07.450
How are we going to do that?

00:01:07.450 --> 00:01:09.160
We'll get over that wall.

00:01:09.910 --> 00:01:10.830
Huh?

00:01:10.830 --> 00:01:12.830
What's with those faces?

00:01:12.830 --> 00:01:15.080
Who do you think I am?

00:01:15.080 --> 00:01:20.330
Sorcerers solve problems with Sorcery
when physical strength won't do the job.

00:01:20.330 --> 00:01:24.370
I scale thee, Heavenly Snowy Mountain!

00:01:34.000 --> 00:01:37.950
"Come to My Tower, Successor"

00:01:39.540 --> 00:01:41.160
This is amazing!

00:01:47.370 --> 00:01:52.950
When you neutralize gravity,
spatial transfer isn't that hard.

00:01:52.950 --> 00:01:54.830
Follow me.

00:01:56.500 --> 00:01:59.620
Are the people from the Uoar Class still here?

00:01:59.620 --> 00:02:02.370
Yeah, I'm pretty sure
they haven't left the tower.

00:02:02.370 --> 00:02:03.620
Why's that?

00:02:03.620 --> 00:02:07.750
If their assassins were in full gear
and were about to make a move at night,

00:02:07.750 --> 00:02:09.540
the guards would find it suspicious.

00:02:09.540 --> 00:02:13.910
And I'm sure that Forte's network
would catch on to them, too.

00:02:13.910 --> 00:02:17.790
In that case, they're going
to go with the easiest option.

00:02:17.790 --> 00:02:20.290
They'd wait until the middle of the night when

00:02:20.290 --> 00:02:23.330
the guards aren't as alert
and leave the tower then.

00:02:23.330 --> 00:02:25.330
But that's right now.

00:02:25.330 --> 00:02:29.790
Right. But there's no way those guys
don't expect me to counteratta--

00:02:29.790 --> 00:02:33.660
But it's not just you! They don't expect us!

00:02:33.660 --> 00:02:37.250
Well, they're only expecting me.

00:02:37.250 --> 00:02:41.290
Couldn't you call everyone
from the Childman Class?

00:02:41.290 --> 00:02:43.250
If I could, I would've done that already.

00:02:43.250 --> 00:02:46.870
Either way, I agree
with striking the enemy first.

00:02:46.870 --> 00:02:51.290
Yeah. If we want to stop some Stabbers,
we can't just wait around.

00:02:51.290 --> 00:02:52.160
And...

00:02:52.160 --> 00:02:53.410
And?

00:02:53.410 --> 00:02:56.580
A part of me wants to find out...

00:02:56.580 --> 00:03:00.330
...if I'm able to take them out on my own.

00:03:00.330 --> 00:03:05.290
If I'm truly the Successor of the Razor's Edge.

00:03:05.290 --> 00:03:07.620
So, what are we going to do now?

00:03:07.620 --> 00:03:09.910
What? You have any good ideas?

00:03:09.910 --> 00:03:16.000
I do! Let's have Leki blow the whole
tower away and the enemies with it!

00:03:17.160 --> 00:03:19.450
Why did I even ask you?

00:03:19.450 --> 00:03:21.410
Huh? Why not, though?

00:03:21.410 --> 00:03:23.370
That's way too reckless!

00:03:23.370 --> 00:03:26.870
Sitting around here
thinking isn't going to help.

00:03:26.870 --> 00:03:29.540
Let's get to the guardroom.

00:03:29.540 --> 00:03:33.540
We'll explain what's going on,
and then we'll just have to go with the flow.

00:03:33.540 --> 00:03:35.950
That seems a bit reckless, too...

00:03:43.790 --> 00:03:46.000
No one's here?

00:03:46.000 --> 00:03:49.500
Has the Uoar Class already made their move?

00:03:49.500 --> 00:03:52.750
No, that just started now.

00:03:52.750 --> 00:03:55.250
Yaslan's Coffin!

00:03:58.750 --> 00:04:00.000
Orphen!

00:04:00.000 --> 00:04:00.910
Stay back!

00:04:00.910 --> 00:04:03.870
I unsheathe thee, Sword of Light!

00:04:06.750 --> 00:04:08.370
I missed?!

00:04:12.000 --> 00:04:13.700
Orphen!

00:04:18.000 --> 00:04:19.660
Swaine?

00:04:19.660 --> 00:04:22.830
Demon Sword of Puanook!

00:04:25.580 --> 00:04:27.540
Leki, save us!

00:04:36.620 --> 00:04:38.910
Let's go out with a bang...

00:04:40.580 --> 00:04:42.830
...Krylancelo.

00:04:43.410 --> 00:04:45.540
Not that I personally mind,

00:04:45.540 --> 00:04:51.290
but cause a huge campfire like this,
and you'll probably attract the guards.

00:04:51.290 --> 00:04:57.120
That's true, but that'd be
Master Uoar Curlaine's problem,

00:04:57.120 --> 00:05:00.620
not me, who belongs to the upper echelon.

00:05:00.620 --> 00:05:03.000
And if they see it as me settling a quarrel

00:05:03.000 --> 00:05:05.330
between the Uoar Class and the Childman Class,

00:05:05.330 --> 00:05:08.620
that'll look good for me, too.

00:05:08.620 --> 00:05:11.330
So you don't care what happens to Uoar?

00:05:11.330 --> 00:05:14.200
He's your former master!

00:05:14.200 --> 00:05:17.700
I only care about killing you!

00:05:20.870 --> 00:05:23.750
You're the one who attacked Tish?!

00:05:23.750 --> 00:05:29.160
And you hid the fact that the
Chaos Witch was alive! What are you plotting?!

00:05:30.790 --> 00:05:33.910
I unsheathe thee, Sword of Light!

00:05:33.910 --> 00:05:36.620
Mirror of Tamankama!

00:05:38.790 --> 00:05:41.910
I scale thee, Heavenly Snowy Mountain!

00:05:45.290 --> 00:05:48.080
I call upon thee, Tiny Spirits!

00:05:52.700 --> 00:05:55.870
I brandish thee, Blade of Demons!

00:05:59.830 --> 00:06:03.580
So you want to settle things here.

00:06:03.580 --> 00:06:08.000
In this training room?
Brings back memories, doesn't it?

00:06:10.120 --> 00:06:13.750
Have you ever thought about this scar of mine?

00:06:13.750 --> 00:06:15.410
Have you?

00:06:15.410 --> 00:06:22.830
Every day... For the past five years,
this scar has haunted me!

00:06:24.040 --> 00:06:27.000
"5 years ago, the royal capital, Mebrenst."

00:06:31.870 --> 00:06:33.450
From Tafrem?

00:06:33.450 --> 00:06:38.290
Don't tell me you got summoned
by the Thirteen Apostles at that age.

00:06:38.290 --> 00:06:43.330
Yes. I came here to accept
the trial to become a court Sorcerer.

00:06:43.330 --> 00:06:46.870
Yeah... Against the wishes of the elders.

00:06:49.080 --> 00:06:51.950
You're Milan Toram from the Uoar Class.

00:06:55.160 --> 00:06:59.080
They call you Hydrant, don't they?

00:06:59.080 --> 00:07:02.250
I hear you're working for the upper echelon now.

00:07:02.250 --> 00:07:03.790
What did you want from me?

00:07:03.790 --> 00:07:06.660
I came here on the elders' orders.

00:07:06.660 --> 00:07:10.910
Apparently, Childman was against
you coming to the royal capital, too.

00:07:10.910 --> 00:07:13.910
But you want to claim the title
of being one of the Thirteen Apostles

00:07:13.910 --> 00:07:17.410
even if it goes against the wishes
of the tower and your master...

00:07:17.410 --> 00:07:21.910
I don't blame you.
That's the highest honor for a Sorcerer.

00:07:21.910 --> 00:07:26.370
But apparently, everyone
doesn't want you to leave.

00:07:26.370 --> 00:07:28.160
What?

00:07:28.160 --> 00:07:31.200
There always needs to be at least one

00:07:31.200 --> 00:07:35.950
Sorcerer who can kill her
at the tower at all times.

00:07:35.950 --> 00:07:37.330
Her...?

00:07:38.500 --> 00:07:40.620
You know who I'm talking about...

00:07:40.620 --> 00:07:43.040
The Chaos Witch!

00:07:44.910 --> 00:07:48.410
You're the only one who can kill that Witch!

00:07:53.700 --> 00:07:58.410
You've been trained to kill her...

00:07:58.410 --> 00:08:00.660
The one and only...

00:08:00.660 --> 00:08:03.080
...assassin that can do that!

00:08:04.620 --> 00:08:08.250
Stop!

00:08:11.040 --> 00:08:15.410
I don't give a rat's ass about
the book Uoar's looking for.

00:08:15.410 --> 00:08:20.330
As long as I get to pay you back for
this scar you gave me at the royal capital!

00:08:20.330 --> 00:08:22.450
Paying people back...

00:08:22.450 --> 00:08:25.540
I wish some acquaintances
of mine would learn that lesson.

00:08:25.540 --> 00:08:27.910
This should make you happy...

00:08:27.910 --> 00:08:33.370
Just like that scar hurt you,
what you told me tormented me!

00:08:33.370 --> 00:08:37.830
And I have to pay you
back for Tish's fingers, too!

00:08:37.830 --> 00:08:41.540
I strike thee, Glass Hail!

00:08:45.950 --> 00:08:49.660
I unsheathe thee, Sword of Light!

00:08:51.750 --> 00:08:53.500
Counterflow!

00:09:00.120 --> 00:09:03.500
I'm more powerful than you
when it comes to Sorcery!

00:09:05.660 --> 00:09:07.450
Did you forget?

00:09:08.660 --> 00:09:12.830
The Childman Class is
not the strongest! It never will be!

00:09:12.830 --> 00:09:15.620
I dance within thee, Heavenly Castle!

00:09:23.910 --> 00:09:28.080
It doesn't mean a damn thing
whose Sorcery is stronger

00:09:28.080 --> 00:09:30.410
when we're in a close quarters battle!

00:09:37.040 --> 00:09:40.950
Orphen? Majic?

00:09:40.950 --> 00:09:42.450
Shine.

00:09:45.000 --> 00:09:47.290
Milan Toram...

00:09:47.290 --> 00:09:49.450
Why did you have to gather
so much attention to yourself?

00:09:49.450 --> 00:09:51.500
What are you thinking?

00:09:51.500 --> 00:09:53.660
Wouldn't you agree, Miss?

00:09:53.660 --> 00:09:55.790
Who are you?

00:09:55.790 --> 00:10:00.500
Vinbi Stotall. That's what I go by these days.

00:10:00.500 --> 00:10:02.910
Come any closer, and I'll scream!

00:10:02.910 --> 00:10:04.500
Silence!

00:10:06.950 --> 00:10:08.910
There should be three of them.

00:10:08.910 --> 00:10:10.370
Huh?

00:10:10.370 --> 00:10:13.830
Milan went after Krylancelo.

00:10:13.830 --> 00:10:16.290
Where did the one named Majic go?

00:10:16.290 --> 00:10:17.620
Damn it...

00:10:17.620 --> 00:10:21.500
I can't even enjoy myself if
this worthless one's the only one left.

00:10:21.500 --> 00:10:23.080
Who are you...

00:10:23.080 --> 00:10:25.620
...calling worthless?!

00:10:25.620 --> 00:10:27.410
You read my mind?

00:10:27.910 --> 00:10:29.540
Melt!

00:10:30.250 --> 00:10:32.330
I don't want to!

00:10:38.250 --> 00:10:40.330
Repair!

00:10:44.790 --> 00:10:47.330
To think that you were a Deep Dragon...

00:10:47.330 --> 00:10:51.160
But it's all over now!

00:10:59.040 --> 00:11:02.120
I call upon thee, Tiny Spirits!

00:11:05.040 --> 00:11:07.950
This place is different
than where we were earlier...

00:11:07.950 --> 00:11:11.330
Oh, right. I was about
to be swallowed up in flames,

00:11:11.330 --> 00:11:13.500
and then Leki moved me somewhere...

00:11:13.500 --> 00:11:17.080
No... There was a cooler way of saying it.

00:11:17.080 --> 00:11:21.120
Shift? Displace? No...

00:11:21.120 --> 00:11:22.370
Transfer.

00:11:22.370 --> 00:11:25.080
Yeah, that! Huh?

00:11:25.080 --> 00:11:29.410
It appears that I was
transferred along with you.

00:11:29.410 --> 00:11:33.790
Apparently, I was transferred
here instead of your master.

00:11:33.790 --> 00:11:37.120
Wait... That stupid beast!

00:11:37.120 --> 00:11:40.500
So that creature's a Deep Dragon...

00:11:40.500 --> 00:11:41.830
But that doesn't matter.

00:11:41.830 --> 00:11:45.540
I'll let Milan have Krylancelo.

00:11:45.540 --> 00:11:47.000
O Swords!

00:11:48.910 --> 00:11:52.250
I knit thee thus, Chainmail of Haloes!

00:12:01.870 --> 00:12:04.450
You can run away all you'd like...

00:12:05.250 --> 00:12:07.500
But are you sure you don't need this?

00:12:09.660 --> 00:12:14.040
To think that you're the one
who had this and not Krylancelo...

00:12:14.040 --> 00:12:18.000
Master trusted me with it!

00:12:18.000 --> 00:12:24.000
You should've kept going.
It's not like you're going to get this back.

00:12:24.000 --> 00:12:28.540
Or... Do you plan on fighting me?

00:12:28.540 --> 00:12:31.750
I can't betray Master's trust!

00:12:33.540 --> 00:12:38.700
And I don't want him to think
I'm holding him back... forever!

00:12:38.700 --> 00:12:47.370
I unsheathe thee, Sword of Light!

00:12:47.370 --> 00:12:50.450
That's hot!

00:12:50.450 --> 00:12:51.910
Did I burn myself?

00:12:53.080 --> 00:12:55.620
I didn't...

00:12:55.620 --> 00:12:57.660
I was able to control it!

00:12:57.660 --> 00:12:59.620
Though...

00:12:59.620 --> 00:13:01.500
You still missed!

00:13:01.500 --> 00:13:03.080
O Swords!

00:13:10.620 --> 00:13:15.250
I should've killed you off
with a single blow from the start.

00:13:15.250 --> 00:13:19.200
That was quite the blow on his part, though.

00:13:19.200 --> 00:13:20.790
But that doesn't matter.

00:13:20.790 --> 00:13:25.750
It doesn't matter how
talented you are if you're dead.

00:13:25.750 --> 00:13:27.540
But you missed.

00:13:27.540 --> 00:13:29.040
What?!

00:13:29.040 --> 00:13:31.910
He spatial transferred?!

00:13:31.910 --> 00:13:35.500
I didn't think it'd actually work...

00:13:35.500 --> 00:13:38.290
That's Master Childman's
ultimate secret technique!

00:13:38.290 --> 00:13:40.750
How could a child like you pull it off?

00:13:40.750 --> 00:13:45.330
That's right... Krylancelo was
able to use that technique, too.

00:13:45.330 --> 00:13:46.870
Is that why?

00:13:46.870 --> 00:13:50.000
It's not like he taught me, but...

00:13:51.450 --> 00:13:54.790
Guess you used up all you had by
using multiple huge techniques at once.

00:13:54.790 --> 00:13:58.450
It doesn't look like you're going
to be using spatial transfer again.

00:14:00.450 --> 00:14:02.000
O Swords!

00:14:02.000 --> 00:14:03.540
Hark, O Light!

00:14:10.870 --> 00:14:12.580
O Wind!

00:14:17.660 --> 00:14:19.660
Don't worry about Swaine.

00:14:19.660 --> 00:14:23.200
Just leave the rest to Krylancelo.

00:14:23.200 --> 00:14:25.330
Outsiders shouldn't interfere.

00:14:25.330 --> 00:14:28.790
Huh? But I'm not an outsider...

00:14:28.790 --> 00:14:32.250
I actually applied to study at the tower...

00:14:32.250 --> 00:14:34.540
I'm aware of that.

00:14:34.540 --> 00:14:37.450
Because you're going to become my student.

00:14:37.450 --> 00:14:38.370
Huh?

00:14:38.950 --> 00:14:41.450
Whatever direction the enemy comes in,

00:14:41.450 --> 00:14:44.540
I'm going to counter them

00:14:44.540 --> 00:14:46.370
at close range!

00:14:48.250 --> 00:14:52.870
This is called Sunda.
It was one of Childman's special techniques.

00:14:52.870 --> 00:14:54.120
Demon Sword of Pua--

00:14:54.120 --> 00:14:55.700
Too late!

00:14:58.580 --> 00:15:01.250
I was taught more martial arts by Childman

00:15:01.250 --> 00:15:06.160
than any Stabber from
the Uoar Class ever learned.

00:15:06.160 --> 00:15:07.660
Yeah...

00:15:07.660 --> 00:15:12.370
So that you could kill the Chaos Witch...

00:15:16.200 --> 00:15:21.330
Just like I tore off half your face last time...

00:15:21.330 --> 00:15:25.120
Guess I'll go for the other half this time.

00:15:26.120 --> 00:15:27.200
D-Don't...

00:15:27.200 --> 00:15:29.330
Stop!

00:15:29.330 --> 00:15:31.580
Maybe you should've thought about that

00:15:31.580 --> 00:15:33.750
before killing the believers
of the Dragon Faiths

00:15:33.750 --> 00:15:37.000
or hurting Tish!

00:15:46.040 --> 00:15:47.660
Orphen?

00:15:50.200 --> 00:15:51.660
Claiomh?

00:15:51.660 --> 00:15:54.500
Thank goodness, you're safe!

00:15:54.500 --> 00:15:56.870
I thought you burned right up!

00:15:56.870 --> 00:15:58.370
I'm glad you're okay, too...

00:15:58.370 --> 00:16:05.410
Some guy named Vinbi attacked me,
but then he tried to kill Leki...

00:16:05.410 --> 00:16:08.160
To think that you were a Deep Dragon...

00:16:08.160 --> 00:16:12.370
But it's all over now!

00:16:22.410 --> 00:16:26.950
And then it looks like Leki transferred me here.

00:16:26.950 --> 00:16:30.040
Wait, is he dead?

00:16:30.040 --> 00:16:31.790
No...

00:16:33.830 --> 00:16:37.040
I guess I'm glad I brought you after all.

00:16:38.200 --> 00:16:41.370
Let's go. We're finishing this.

00:16:46.540 --> 00:16:48.750
You're late.

00:16:49.580 --> 00:16:54.870
Do you really think assassins are that punctual?

00:16:54.870 --> 00:17:00.540
What I am surprised about is
that you brought your friends with you.

00:17:00.540 --> 00:17:04.330
I thought that you always acted alone.

00:17:04.330 --> 00:17:09.450
But you lose. I just received this.

00:17:09.450 --> 00:17:15.040
It appears that Swaine was able
to take this from your student.

00:17:15.040 --> 00:17:18.080
Well, I don't have much patience tonight.

00:17:18.080 --> 00:17:19.910
There are times where
I'm dealing with weasels who don't

00:17:19.910 --> 00:17:22.950
know how to return things
that don't belong to them...

00:17:22.950 --> 00:17:26.450
Or dealing with a selfish little girl...

00:17:26.450 --> 00:17:30.790
Where I shoot off some Sorcery
while yelling a bit, but...

00:17:32.290 --> 00:17:36.870
But watching a bastard like you squirm...

00:17:36.870 --> 00:17:39.660
...I can't even get angry.

00:17:39.660 --> 00:17:43.080
That book in your hand...
The World Transcript, was it?

00:17:43.080 --> 00:17:47.580
How many lives did you take
to get your hands on that book?

00:17:47.580 --> 00:17:50.160
I see that you underestimate me greatly.

00:17:50.160 --> 00:17:55.160
It's because of this book that
Childman rose to the heights he did.

00:17:55.160 --> 00:17:57.120
There is an incredibly
powerful Sorcery technique

00:17:57.120 --> 00:18:00.950
written in ancient runes within this book.

00:18:00.950 --> 00:18:03.040
Ancient runes, eh?

00:18:03.040 --> 00:18:06.830
I mean... They're definitely hard to read.

00:18:11.080 --> 00:18:16.250
Her diary just happened
to be about the same size.

00:18:16.250 --> 00:18:20.250
I changed up a few things
to make it look like the other book.

00:18:20.250 --> 00:18:22.870
Why you...

00:18:25.250 --> 00:18:26.790
Finish him!

00:18:33.830 --> 00:18:35.660
O Spear!

00:18:41.450 --> 00:18:43.160
Forte!

00:18:43.160 --> 00:18:46.660
Master Uoar Curlaine and students...

00:18:46.660 --> 00:18:49.080
You'll be taken into custody for attacking

00:18:49.080 --> 00:18:51.200
the high-ranking Sorcerer from
the Childman Class, Leticia MacCredy,

00:18:51.200 --> 00:18:55.580
as well as possibly murdering
believers of the Dragon Faiths.

00:18:55.580 --> 00:18:59.200
These are orders from the upper echelon.

00:18:59.200 --> 00:19:01.660
The upper echelon?

00:19:01.660 --> 00:19:08.000
This order has Hydrant...
Milan Toram's signature on it.

00:19:08.000 --> 00:19:11.250
He is part of the upper echelon, after all.

00:19:11.250 --> 00:19:14.830
I had him sign it in
exchange for letting him go,

00:19:14.830 --> 00:19:18.750
since the elders aren't around
to sign these orders themselves.

00:19:18.750 --> 00:19:23.120
But it looks like you're
breaking some other rules as well.

00:19:23.120 --> 00:19:25.330
Would you like to call off this battle,

00:19:25.330 --> 00:19:27.660
or would you like to be
destroyed right here, right now?

00:19:27.660 --> 00:19:30.330
I'm not as kind as Krylancelo.

00:19:30.330 --> 00:19:33.000
I'm not as used to fighting.
So I don't know how to

00:19:33.000 --> 00:19:35.370
hold back enough so you won't be killed.

00:19:35.370 --> 00:19:42.750
You plan to take us on with your numbers,
Instructor Forte Puckingham?

00:19:42.750 --> 00:19:45.200
Do I not count?

00:19:46.620 --> 00:19:48.290
Azalie!

00:19:51.080 --> 00:19:53.080
What are you doing here?

00:19:53.080 --> 00:19:56.000
It was too dangerous to let
you handle this on your own.

00:19:56.000 --> 00:19:58.000
Forte's here, too.

00:19:59.200 --> 00:20:01.160
You knew?

00:20:01.160 --> 00:20:05.250
Of course... the network...

00:20:05.250 --> 00:20:07.290
Looks like you got a bit careless.

00:20:07.290 --> 00:20:10.120
You were trying to face the Childman Class,

00:20:10.120 --> 00:20:13.450
but only had your eyes on Krylancelo.

00:20:15.790 --> 00:20:18.620
The Chaos Witch!

00:20:32.870 --> 00:20:37.540
The one and only technique
I inherited from Childman...

00:20:37.540 --> 00:20:43.580
A technique that can kill people instantly
and easily make someone a Stabber.

00:20:56.250 --> 00:20:58.830
Move, Krylancelo.

00:20:58.830 --> 00:21:01.000
You can't go any further, can you?

00:21:01.000 --> 00:21:03.500
I'm going to erase any memories of me

00:21:03.500 --> 00:21:06.620
from Uoar and his students' minds.

00:21:08.660 --> 00:21:10.660
Chaos Witch...

00:21:14.120 --> 00:21:18.370
Begone to Oblivion!

00:21:29.950 --> 00:21:31.620
Take them.

00:21:35.040 --> 00:21:39.500
So basically, you and Azalie used me.

00:21:39.500 --> 00:21:41.200
I thank you.

00:21:41.200 --> 00:21:46.700
I was having a hard time trying to
figure out how to get rid of the Uoar Class.

00:21:46.700 --> 00:21:50.500
Do you really think you can control the tower...

00:21:52.040 --> 00:21:53.950
...like Master did?

00:21:55.580 --> 00:21:58.620
To think that Master had died...

00:22:01.700 --> 00:22:06.040
I brought the real one from Tish's mansion.

00:22:06.040 --> 00:22:09.200
Wait, how did Uoar find out about that book?

00:22:09.200 --> 00:22:10.620
Don't tell me...

00:22:10.620 --> 00:22:14.500
It was the perfect opportunity
to make the Uoar Class do my bidding.

00:22:14.500 --> 00:22:18.950
Though there's no amazing Sorcery in here.

00:22:18.950 --> 00:22:20.790
Then what does it...

00:22:24.000 --> 00:22:25.540
Azalie!

00:22:25.540 --> 00:22:28.660
We haven't settled things yet!

00:22:28.660 --> 00:22:32.580
"If you have doubts
in this world, look no further."

00:22:32.580 --> 00:22:36.660
What's written in this book that
was kept in the World-Seeing Tower?

00:22:36.660 --> 00:22:39.250
The change in this world.

00:22:39.250 --> 00:22:43.870
No one's realized it, but this world
is headed towards destruction.

00:22:45.000 --> 00:22:49.910
If you truly want to settle things
with me, come to Kimluck.

00:22:56.410 --> 00:22:59.500
Azalie had disappeared...

00:22:59.500 --> 00:23:02.790
She wanted to find something out.

00:23:02.790 --> 00:23:06.290
Is it for her former friends?

00:23:06.290 --> 00:23:09.700
For her master who lost his life?

00:23:09.700 --> 00:23:14.330
Or does it have to do with the world ending?

00:23:14.330 --> 00:23:18.750
Orphen's journey continues
to uncover that mystery!

00:23:22.330 --> 00:23:24.200
Kimluck...

00:23:37.950 --> 00:23:41.500
Everything began once that sword activated...

00:23:41.500 --> 00:23:44.120
What was Master trying to do?

00:23:44.120 --> 00:23:44.950
I'm going to find out!

00:23:44.950 --> 00:23:45.290
"Celestial Artifacts"

00:23:45.290 --> 00:23:46.950
"Celestial Artifacts"
Sis...
